<title>USA: Microage sees Q1 EPS $0.25-$0.30.</title>
<headline>Microage sees Q1 EPS $0.25-$0.30.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroAge Inc said Thursday it expects first quarter earnings of $0.25 to $0.30 a share, up from $0.11 a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it made the announcement in reaction to a decline in its stock price this week.</p>
<p>Analysts' consensus first quarter earnings estimate is $0.29 a share, with estimates ranging from $0.25 to $0.32, according to First Call.</p>
<p>Microage shares were up 1-1/4 to 14 at mid-morning.</p>
